<title>USA: St Paul hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 higher. Top $60.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3     220-250 lbs    60.00</p>
<p>	     250-260 lbs    59.50-60.00</p>
<p>	     260-270 lbs    58.50-59.50</p>
<p>US 2-3     270-280 lbs    57.50-58.50</p>
<p>Sows: steady. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3     300-700 lbs    47.50-48.00</p>
</text>
